  "prefLabel": "He-C 204.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 204.01 Purpose. The rules in this part are intended to supplement any statutory provisions, including but not limited to RSA 541, which require or allow a person to request reconsideration of a decision of the department prior to or in lieu of appealing the decision.\n\nSource. #6986, eff 4-24-99; ss by #8866-A, eff 4-13-07",
